  "summary": "Sitting on the short box with one foot under the strap, hold the other leg, straighten it, then walk the hands up and down it as the spine rolls back over the box and up again.",
  "steps": [
    "Sit on the short box, one foot under the strap; hold behind the other thigh with the knee bent.",
    "Stretch that leg up three times.",
    "Keeping it up, walk the hands down the leg as you roll back over the box.",
    "Walk the hands back up the leg to sit tall and fold over it."
